      "content": "it doesnt feel like \"self-doubt\" though. it feels like a fact. i watch them struggle with school or being sick or just being lonely and i know it's because i'm not enough. i'm just dragging them down into this hole with me. they'd probably have a much easier, lighter life if they didn't have to worry about me and my constant messiness.",
