      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand how heavy and isolating these thoughts feel, and I want you to know that wishing for your child's happiness do not actually wish to harm them or wish for you to be a \"good\" enough person. Your intention to help, even when it feels like it's failing, is a testament to your deep love rather than a reason to abandon them. Please consider speaking with a therapist who can help you see that you are the only safe place they have in the world.",
      "source": "target",
